653
00:59:15.556 --> 00:59:19.142
Actually, tomorrow
you don't sail until midday.

654
00:59:20.018 --> 00:59:23.480
That is to say, low tide is noon,
and as a rule you sail at low tide.

655
00:59:28.986 --> 00:59:30.987
