on Plymouth Island.

696
01:03:13.377 --> 01:03:15.921
Catch the cat. Count the sprats.

697
01:03:16.672 --> 01:03:19.674
You get logs
and frigate birds and fish finders

698
01:03:19.758 --> 01:03:20.759
